<title>USA: Labor Ready seeks acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Labor Ready seeks acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>TACOMA, Wash 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Labor Ready Inc said it intends to seek acquisitions in the temporary staffing industry to accelerate revenue growth and expand market share.</p>
<p>It said it will target candidates with at least a $15 million revenue base and those having a strong presence in the light industrial, as well as in the clerical, contracting, temporary to permanent sourcing and professional employer organization sectors.</p>
<p>It said its strategic acquisition strategy will assist Labor Ready in exceeding its objective to be a $1 billion company by 2001.</p>
</text>
